  "reason": "tree-sitter-xml #40: Name (attribute, namespace-declaration, DOCTYPE, DTD and entity names) follows the XML 1.0 NameStartChar and NameChar ranges, so non-ASCII names such as 속성 and xmlns:접두 parse; ':' still cannot start a name and the ASCII set is unchanged. Each listed difference is a patch-corpus input (the Hangul/other-script attribute and entity names) or its seeded edit in which a non-ASCII name now parses; the upstream corpus, its edits and the pinned large input are unchanged.",
